  "body": " Grading Chart   Instructions: As you complete assignments in the course, check off the boxes here, starting from below. Once you've checked all the boxes in a row for the course, you've earned the grade corresponding to the row.   Grade modifiers: If you earned over 90 engagement credits and satisfied the requirements for a base grade , you will get a + grade. For example: 9 learning targets, 3 challenge problems, and 10 homework assignments, along with 100 engagement credits is a B+. If you have at least one learning target and one challenge problem above the requirement for a particular grade you will earn the next highest minus grade. Example: 10 learning targets, 4 challenge problems, and 10 homework assignments is an A     Grade  Learning Targets  Challenge Problems  Homework Assignments  Engagement Credits (+)    A  ☐ ☐ ☐ ☐  ☐ ☐  ☐  70+ ☐    B  ☐ ☐ ☐  ☐ ☐  ☐ ☐ ☐ ☐  N\/A    C  ☐ ☐ ☐  ☐  ☐ ☐ ☐  N\/A    D  ☐ ☐ ☐  N\/A  ☐ ☐ ☐  N\/A    "
